    "task_id": "MULTI-JUSO-ZIP-001",
    "instruction": "I need to find all the road name addresses associated with a specific zip code. Please search for the zip code '05272' on the juso.go.kr website. Extract all the road name addresses (도로명주소) that appear in the search results. Save the results in the spreadsheet starting at A1 with headers 'Zip Code (우편번호)' and 'Road Name Address (도로명주소)'. Record '05272' in column A and each corresponding road name address in column B for all results.",
